      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Burr Ridge’s gently rolling hills were carved by glaciers at the end of the last ice age, placing most of the village on the Valparaiso Moraine.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
